OL,3,GNEWSAOlney enters crowded field for
OL,4,A2028 mayor election
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichmond MP Sarah Olney has announced
OL,7,Fthat she wants to be the next mayor of
OL,8,FLondon.
OL,10,FShe is not the only one.
OL,12,FThe election may be more than 19 months
OL,13,Faway, but several candidates have
OL,14,Frecently declared their desire to
OL,15,Freplace Sir Sadiq Khan as the leader of
OL,16,FLondon.
