OL,3,GNEWSAOlney enters crowded field for
OL,4,A2028 mayor election
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a high profile job, and the mayor
OL,7,Fhas the largest personal electoral
OL,8,Fmandate of any individual politician in
OL,9,Fthe UK - the Greater London Authority
OL,10,Fmayoral constituency has around 6.2
OL,11,Fmillion voters.
